  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal singleprofile models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 achieve ~0.525 validation accuracy. This experiment tests multiprofile with the same encoders but avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, isolating the impact of profile setting. It balances exploration of multiprofile (a key design choice) while keeping encoders consistent, providing critical evidence on whether multiprofile improves performance without overcomplicating other factors."
